  "description": "The cache content group **web_content_group** is defined for **HTTP** traffic on the host **cache01.example.com** and leverages the **IntegratedCaching** feature. Its cache\u2011control header is set to **\u201cmax-age=3600\u201d**. Absolute expiry is configured for **30\u202fdays**, with the corresponding GMT timestamp of **2026\u201112\u201131T23:59:59Z**, and the group is set to expire at the last byte (**YES**). In addition, a relative expiry of **30\u202fseconds** (30\u202f000\u202fms) is applied, with weak negative and positive overrides of **15\u202fseconds** and **20\u202fseconds** respectively, and an hour\u2011based expiry parameter of **4** hours. The query used for cache inspection is **\u201cSELECT * FROM cache\u201d** and the selector value for policy matching is **\u201csomeValue\u201d**. Persistence is enabled (**YES**) but HA persistence is turned off (**NO**); the group is not pinned and it does not route to a secondary cache (**NO**). The invalidation policy permits up to **5** entries, is not restricted to a host, and uses the **URL** selector with the pattern **\u201c*/api/*\u201d**. The applied policy is named **defaultPolicy**, and policy evaluation on every request is disabled (**polleverytime = NO**, **alwaysevalpolicies = NO**).  \n\nCaching statistics show **256 cache cells**, **12\u202f345** hits that resulted in **304** responses and **23\u202f456** non\u2011304 hits. Memory usage stands at **2\u202f048\u202fMB** (limit **8\u202f192\u202fMB**, current usage **3\u202f072\u202fMB**) with a disk consumption of **5\u202f000\u202f000** units. The group holds **2 marker cells**, a flag value of **3**, and the flash cache is disabled (**NO**). Hit parameters include **param1 = value1**, while hit selection follows the **DEFAULT** rule. Case\u2011sensitive parameter values are enforced (**ignoreparamvaluecase = NO**), reload requests are ignored (**ignorereloadreq = YES**), and request\u2011caching headers are not ignored (**ignorereqcachinghdrs = NO**). Age, ETag and Via headers are inserted as follows: **Age = YES**, **ETag = YES**, **Via = NO**. Lazy DNS resolution is enabled (**YES**), cookie matching and removal are both disabled (**matchcookies = NO**, **removecookies = NO**). The maximum response size allowed is **1\u202f048\u202f576\u202fbytes**, with a minimum response size of **1\u202f024\u202fbytes** and a minimum hit count of **10**. Prefetching is active (**YES**) with **3** current prefetches, a maximum of **5** pending, running every **60\u202fseconds** (60\u202f000\u202fms). Quick abort size is set to **65\u202f536\u202fbytes** and the cache\u2011group incarnation identifier is **1**."
